import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 300 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families: Knowledge Monopoly and Class Solidification","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 300 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families: Knowledge Monopoly and Class Solidification","no":300,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families","Knowledge Monopoly","Class Solidification","Oligarchic Civilization"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","47-Anti-Monopoly Law","36-Social Structure and Class Mobility"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0300_模块2-遮天-荒古世家.md","filePath":"en/0300_模块2-遮天-荒古世家.md"}'),a={name:"en/0300_模块2-遮天-荒古世家.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,u){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-300-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-desolate-ancient-aristocratic-families-knowledge-monopoly-and-class-solidification" tabindex="-1">Entry 300 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families: Knowledge Monopoly and Class Solidification <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-300-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-desolate-ancient-aristocratic-families-knowledge-monopoly-and-class-solidification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 300 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families: Knowledge Monopoly and Class Solidification&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 13) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 47, 36</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-cultivation-itself-becomes-a-bloodline-question" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When cultivation itself becomes a bloodline question <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-cultivation-itself-becomes-a-bloodline-question" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When cultivation itself becomes a bloodline question&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Great Dao all-tier public, no private Dao and no monopoly; the anti-predation axiom opposes strong ones monopolizing knowledge and Great Dao. This entry dissects Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families&quot; — those bloodline families transmitting from antiquity to today, holding top methods and resources. They are not villains, but the legal skeleton of Shrouding&#39;s class solidification. The law-first axiom reminds: the family institution is world-view-default &quot;legitimate order&quot;; critique must point to institutions, not individuals. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Aristocratic-family system&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li>Top methods, emperor scriptures circulate only inside families; all-society geniuses cannot access them, massive potential strong ones wasted at mid-low tiers</li><li>Family children get &quot;trial-and-error rights&quot; by birth; ordinary geniuses without resources repeatedly struggle at low tiers, talent mismatch</li><li>Families to preserve monopoly consume massive energy on guarding out, guarding theft, guarding splitting; internal friction severe</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Aristocratic-family solidification&#39;s regression consequences:</p><ol><li><strong>Upward channels locked</strong>: birth determines ceiling; poor geniuses even with peerless aptitude can barely access top legacies</li><li><strong>Close-relative degeneration</strong>: family internal transmission narrows narrower, methods rigidify in repeated compilations</li><li><strong>Revolution cycles</strong>: monopoly accumulates to critical point, inevitably erupts &quot;poor family flips the table&quot; wars; civilization energy zeroes out again in revolution</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan though from a poor family, ultimately is &quot;co-opted&quot; by the aristocratic-family system as a new oligarch:</p><ul><li><strong>Overthrow old families, become a new family</strong>: Ye Fan breaks several old-line families; he and his trusted allies become the new top</li><li><strong>Methods still transmitted selectively</strong>: even after Ye Fan realizes Dao, his core legacy is still &quot;select heirs,&quot; not &quot;open to Myriad Ranks&quot;</li><li><strong>New bottle old wine</strong>: old families&#39; monopoly structure is not overturned, only a new batch of surnames</li></ul><p>Ye Fan&#39;s predatory thinking manifests: his way of resisting families is to become a stronger family, not to abolish the family institution.</p><p>Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families also have an often-romanticized dimension: they are narratively depicted as positive images of &quot;long transmission, deep heritage.&quot; But by Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s eyes, long heritage is precisely the problem — a family that has transmitted a hundred thousand years means this world has not produced new upward channels for a hundred thousand years; the most excellent talents in those hundred thousand years still can only attach to old families. A truly healthy civilization should be every generation new forces rise, old forces naturally turnover, not a few surnames sitting on the throne for a hundred thousand years. Ye Fan breaks old families but becomes a new family, showing he only completed blood-transfusion, not institution-transfusion — blood-transfusion will re-solidify; institution-transfusion roots out.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Desolate Ancient Family Monopoly</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Emperor scriptures family-esoteric</td><td>300 Origin systems fully public, no private Dao</td></tr><tr><td>Birth determines ceiling</td><td>Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System, regardless of birth</td></tr><tr><td>Monopoly guards out</td><td>Anti-Monopoly Law forbids method and resource monopolies</td></tr><tr><td>Poor-revolution-zeroing cycle</td><td>20% Activation Strategy broadly cultivates geniuses, avoiding revolution</td></tr><tr><td>New bottle old wine</td><td>Civilization charter writes &quot;Great Dao public&quot;</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Desolate Ancient families&#39; transmission closure and social upward-channel width</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;methods network-public&quot; vs. &quot;maintain family monopoly&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: poor-family success rate, revolution outbreak cycle</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — after methods public, whole-society success rate rises several times; &quot;poor flips the table&quot; revolution cycle is rooted out</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. Family settings early self-consistent; late to make way for Ye Fan, old-line families &quot;passing by = destroyed,&quot; count and strength fluctuate</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Family strength varies strong and weak by protagonist need</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Ye Fan ultimately becomes new oligarch, family structure under his hand continues rather than overturns</li></ul><p>Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families also have an often-overlooked economic base: they have existed a hundred thousand years because they monopolize resource-distribution channels. Poor geniuses even with peerless aptitude must go through families to get cultivation resources — families need not directly forbid you to cultivate; they only need to control resource channels to make you naturally eliminated. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s resource distribution by joint contracting precisely takes resource channels from families back to public, so poor geniuses need not attach to any family to get what they need.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: talent mismatch, guard-out internal friction, method rigidification</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: distributing Great Dao and resources by bloodline is the most thorough knowledge predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo explicitly makes breaking aristocratic monopoly his mission; Ye Fan though breaks old families does not abolish the institution</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: under the family system poor families and Myriad-Rank branches are always the excluded</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: bloodline-solidified cosmos cannot open upward channels to Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families are not Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;setting flavor,&quot; but evidence it cannot design fairness. A world that distributes the highest methods by bloodline — what &quot;Great Dao&quot; can it talk about?</p><p>Breaking old families is easy, Ye Fan did it; abolishing the family institution is hard, Shrouding did not. The difference between blood-transfusion and institution-transfusion is the difference between oligarchic and symbiotic civilization.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Desolate Ancient Aristocratic Families described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./299_模块2-遮天-源天师与源术.html">Entry 299 · Source Masters and Source Arts</a> · <a href="./302_模块2-遮天-人族本位批判.html">Entry 302 · Human-Centered Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/47-反垄断法.html">47-Anti-Monopoly Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
